## Aggregate notice / 聚合说明

This repository is an **aggregate** of a hub shell plus independently licensed
games. The MIT text above covers:

- the hub (`index.html`, `css/`, `assets/`, documentation at the repo root)
- original games that do not ship their own license file (including
  `games/go/`, `games/gomoku/`, `games/junqi/`, `games/fps/`, `games/redcap/`)

Subdirectories that include their own license **keep that license**:

| Path | License |
|---|---|
| `games/xiangqi/` | MIT |
| `games/monopoly/` | ISC |
| `games/street-duty/` | MIT |
| `games/pocket/` | MIT |
| `games/chess3d/` | **GNU GPL-3.0** (`games/chess3d/LICENSE.md`) |

`games/chess3d/` is GPL-3.0. Combining or redistributing that game with this
aggregate must follow GPL-3.0 for the chess3d files (and any work that is a
derivative of them). The hub MIT grant does **not** relicense chess3d.

Third-party sources and notes: `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`.
